First, Marty cuts 100 centimeters of ribbon into 4 equal parts.  
$$
\frac{100}{4} = 25 \text{ cm}
$$  
Each of these 25 cm parts is then divided into 5 equal parts.  
$$
\frac{25}{5} = 5 \text{ cm}
$$  
Each final cut will be **5 centimeters** long.

